{"id":6282804161,"name":"Hold People: The Game [Voice Chat]","desc":"A game where you hold people and throw them off the map.\n\nThe longer in the game you stay the more time you get. You can use time to buy things in the shop basically they act like coins. There is also an obby you can earn time from completing. There are also many secrets around the map, like a cave, a sword and even lava! Another thing you could also do is pick up people and do weird things with them like throwing them off the map and hurting them in other ways. If you want to you can also decorate a house using things in the map!\n\nPc Hold: E\nMobile Hold: Button\n\nThis game is playable in singeplayer and multiplayer. The genres present in the game are Obby, Adventure, Decorating, Battle and Glitches or using bugs","path":"/game/6282804161-hold-people-the-game","slug":"6282804161-hold-people-the-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/439f7fea50bb95a5e150e20cc874563543ef8898991cc4a4d451916c1cdf6f17.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e80bc2794cf8750c3277f844b08a842f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":13320893,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-03-20T10:43:11.815Z","creator":{"name":"⁕Mushroomz Games⁕","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"65fabdbf120518365d8ab353","title":"Script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78865","gameId":6282804161,"name":"Hold People: The Game [Voice Chat]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"6282804161-hold-people-the-game","path":"/game/6282804161-hold-people-the-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":6282804161},"slug":"Hold-People:-The-Game-Voice-Chat-Script-11465","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":14657,"executes":565,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexU